[h1]JinGu (今古群侠传) · Open-Source Mod + Data Reference Site[/h1]

A community-built mod and data tool for the single-player wuxia RPG [b]今古群侠传 (JinGu)[/b]. Skips repetitive grind (mob loops, gathering, affection farming) so you can spend more time on story and exploration.

[b]Single-player only. Does not affect multiplayer or other players.[/b]

[previewyoutube=REPLACE_WITH_YOUTUBE_VIDEO_ID;full][/previewyoutube]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]📦 Download[/h2]
GitHub release (Windows 10/11, ~22 MB):
[url=https://github.com/tantk/psychic-kungfu-master-mod/releases/latest]https://github.com/tantk/psychic-kungfu-master-mod/releases/latest[/url]

Full source on GitHub (MIT-licensed):
[url=https://github.com/tantk/psychic-kungfu-master-mod]github.com/tantk/psychic-kungfu-master-mod[/url]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]🛠 Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Player stats: max money, god mode, six pillars (根骨/力道/...), martial XP, reputation (good-evil/fame/romance)
[*]Exploration: free actions, freeze time, energy refill, advance the world clock
[*]One-click mini-game skip: fishing, hunting, taming, alchemy, forging
[*]Items browser: all 948 items with the game's native two-level category filter, sortable columns, click-to-add to inventory
[*]NPC editor: stats, kungfu loadout, affection, friend-level (drives companion character-swap)
[*]Sect editor: mass-favor adjustment across all NPCs in a sect
[*]5 swappable wuxia themes, 10 fonts, customizable per-cheat hotkeys
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]🎁 Companion Data Reference Site[/h2]
[url=https://tantk.github.io/psychic-kungfu-master-mod/]tantk.github.io/psychic-kungfu-master-mod[/url]

[list]
[*][b]Items[/b] tab - all 948 items, filter by game's own categories, sort by value/quality
[*][b]Gifts[/b] tab - what each NPC likes / specially loves / hates, filter by faction
[/list]

No install needed. Browser-based — handy for quickly looking up gift preferences mid-game.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]💾 Install[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Download [b]JinGuCheats-Setup-v0.1.0.exe[/b] from the Releases link above
[*]Double-click to run (if SmartScreen warns, click [b]More info → Run anyway[/b])
[*]The wizard auto-detects your game folder, patches the Mono runtime, drops mod files into Mods\
[*]Launch the game through Steam — the cheat UI window opens automatically
[/olist]

Full README with manual install fallback:
[url=https://github.com/tantk/psychic-kungfu-master-mod#readme]README[/url]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]⚠ About Antivirus[/h2]
Windows Defender and other AV products may flag the cheat DLL — it hooks into another process and uses reflection, which is the same technique malware uses. [b]The source is fully open[/b] for inspection.

If flagged:
[list]
[*]Allow the file (Windows Security → Virus & threat protection → Allowed threats)
[*]Or add an exclusion for the game folder
[/list]

